# Brand assets — large reference package; keep out of the repo until a
# dedicated artefact store (S3 / R2 / Git LFS) is chosen. See workspace
# hygiene audit, 2026-04-26.
docs/branding/

# Impeccable design-skill context files. Local-only working artefacts
# read by .claude/skills/impeccable/scripts/load-context.mjs. The skill
# itself lives under the gitignored .claude/ tree; these context files
# travel with it but have no consumer in tracked code, hooks, or CI.
# Same category as .claude/, .superpowers/, graphify-out/, docs/branding/.
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md

# ONSPD download — not committed (~1GB)
prisma/scripts/.local/

# Local runtime cache — Google Places usage state
# (Plan 4 M2.3.5 — local hard-stop replacing the un-adjustable Google quota).
# Stores daily + monthly call counts with per-source breakdown (`bySource`,
# e.g. `admin_cli`, future `merchant_portal`) so the wrapper can refuse
# fetch once either cap is reached. Owner-machine state, never repo state.
.cache/
